  <revision rev="10" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>8f3c8ed23bbe1fd0e8a7d25488ad52bc</srcmd5>
    <version>4.22.5</version>
    <time>1786026113</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update python-cyclopts to 4.22.5.

Bug fixes around abstract collection types:
- Fix a TypeError raised when an abstract collection parameter is given no values
- Support the Collection, Container and Reversible type hints
- Add --empty-* flags for abstract collection hints

Verified locally on aarch64/openSUSE_Tumbleweed: build green, rpmlint 0 errors
0 warnings, spec-cleaner diff empty, source_validator clean. The sdist ships no
tests, so %check remains the import smoke test.</comment>
    <requestid>1369633</requestid>
  </revision>
